Codex Monitor was designed after studying Claude Code Monitor:
https://github.com/kchernev/claude-code-monitor

Claude Code Monitor is Copyright (c) 2026 Kaloyan Chernev and licensed under
the MIT License. Its ideas around local-first monitoring, project grouping,
deduplication, cache safety, localhost web security, and read-only Git
observation informed this project. Codex Monitor's Codex source adapter,
normalized SQLite schema, byte-offset incremental parser, CLI, and web UI were
written for Codex's distinct rollout event format.
